nduring love and commitment to each other.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"Anna and Herbert are a true power couple in the German entertainment industry,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Julia Fuchs, a German pop culture expert and professor at the University of Berlin.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"Their marriage is a testament to the strength of their love and their ability to balance their successful careers with their personal life.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"The couple's love story is all the more remarkable given their individual achievements in the entertainment industry.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer, born in 1953, was a talented actress who appeared in numerous German films and television shows throughout her career.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Herbert Grönemeyer, born in 1956, is a multi-platinum selling singer, musician, and actor who has been a household name in Germany for decades.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"Herbert and Anna are an inspiration to us all,\\\" said German actress and friend, Iris Berben.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"\\\"They've built a life together that's filled with love, laughter, and a deep respect for each other's talents and passions.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Data from the German Federal Statistical Office shows that the couple's marriage has endured for over three decades, a rarity in the entertainment industry.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"According to a 2020 survey by the German magazine, _Bunte_, Herbert Grönemeyer and Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer were ranked among the top 10 most beloved celebrity couples in Germany.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"While the couple's personal life has been subject to media scrutiny over the years, they have consistently demonstrated their commitment to each other.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"In a 2015 interview with _Die Zeit_, Herbert Grönemeyer spoke about the importance of his marriage, saying, \\\"Anna is my rock, my partner, and my best friend.\"}]}"
